[l_english.STATE_LORE_543]
The Apple Family is the founder of Ponyville and one of the first residents of Ponyville. Nearly a hundred years ago, they settled here and established the famous Sweet Apple Acres. The apples produced here are not only of huge output, but also of superior quality, making it the most famous apple producing area in Ponyville. Members of the Apple Family are known for their hard work, honesty, and friendliness, and their family spirit has always been a model for Ponyville. Until — the winter destroyed everything.
During the agricultural reform of Ponyville, Mayor Mare arranged for Trixie to organize the felling of Sweet Apple Acres to stockpile wood for the winter and plant cold-resistant crops. With the insistence of Granny Smith and the Apple Family, they saved most of the Sweet Apple Acres, but the following years of harsh winter prevented them from returning to their former glory. After Granny Smith gave up the defense of Sweet Apple Acres, almost all members of the Apple Family moved back to Appleloosa to live with “Cousin” Braeburn. Today, Sweet Apple Acres is still guarded by several members of the Apple Family, but it is no longer the same as it used to be, and it may soon cease to exist.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_543]
苹果家族是小马谷的缔造者，也是小马谷的首批居民。近百年前，他们就已经在这里定居，建立了知名的香甜苹果园。这里产出苹果不仅产量巨大，而且品质上乘，是小马谷最著名的苹果产地。苹果家族的成员们以勤劳、诚实、友善著称，他们的家族精神也一直是小马谷的楷模。直到 —— 冬天摧毁了一切。
小马谷农业改革期间，梅耶镇长安排特丽克西组织对香甜苹果园的砍伐，以储备木材过冬、改种抗寒作物。在史密斯奶奶和苹果家族的坚持下，他们保住了大半苹果园，但随后的数年寒冬则让他们再也没能恢复昔日的辉煌。在史密斯奶奶放弃对香甜苹果园的坚守后，苹果家族几乎全部搬回了苹果鲁萨，与“表哥”布雷本一起生活。如今，香甜苹果园依然在苹果家族的几名成员的守护下，但已经不再是昔日的模样，或许很快就将不复存在。
